[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) for the counter-balance shaft pulley using\nthe tool (1b) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.288.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the counter-balance shaft pulley.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002169.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the counter-balance shaft pulley (1a) back in its housing\nand secure it by tightening the bolt (1b) to the recommended torque\nusing the tool (1c) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COUNTER-ROTATING SHAFT PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Counter balance shaft side) 4.5 ÷ 5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.288.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002170.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]